# OS / editor cruft
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*.swp

# Dropbox conflict copies — this repo lives inside a Dropbox folder
*conflicted copy*

# Charles University source artwork: the Illustrator file and print PDF the
# served emblem was traced from. Kept locally (and in Dropbox), out of the
# repository — this repo has to be public for Pages, and republishing the
# University's source art is a separate thing from using the emblem to show
# affiliation. Nothing on the site loads these; assets/img/cu-emblem.svg does
# all the work. See README, "The Charles University emblem".
assets/img/CUcoat/

# Original photographs. The site serves one derived crop,
# assets/img/tomas-haufer-portrait.jpg, cut from 54899135309 and centred on the
# face; these are the full-size originals, and there is no reason to publish
# six near-identical 800 KB frames. The crop is reproducible — see README.
assets/img/photo/

# CERGE-EI programme print material: the Master in Economic Research leaflet and
# A3 poster. The Prague drawing on the home page was lifted out of the leaflet
# as vector (assets/img/prague-cerge.svg, which IS committed), but that is a
# different thing from republishing the school's print files in a public repo.
# Same reasoning as CUcoat/ above.
assets/img/prg/

# Czech Academy of Sciences logo artwork. Not used by the site at all; vendor
# source files, same reasoning again.
assets/img/AVcoat/
